@arcee_ai announces a partnership with the Department of Energy to build Genesis-Science-1, an open model for scientific research. GS1 is an open-weight AI model designed to complete scientific computing workflows while maintaining a reproducible record of its work.

The model will be shaped by researchers, labs, universities, companies, and nonprofits involved in scientific work. DOE is opening a contributor program to involve the community, and infrastructure partners will help add training or evaluation capacity. There’s still lots of work ahead, and the goal is to build this openly, starting with GS1.

