He expresses concern about the difficulty for employees without internal access to understand the current state of AI models, citing recent system cards from Anthropic that withhold information for competitive reasons. Elie hopes for increased transparency and collaboration in the field.

@OpenAI: "At the core of our mission is working through how to ensure increasingly powerful AI benefits everyone. We believe that, at some point in the future, AI acceleration for frontier model development may be so high that the world will need to pace the rate of AI advancement. We hope to contribute to work led by the U.S. government, alongside other labs and the open-source community, to develop the tools and mechanisms that could make that possible."
